### Component Props

Respect Shadcn/ui component APIs:

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Use variant props
<Button variant="default">Primary</Button>
<Button variant="outline">Secondary</Button>
<Button variant="ghost">Tertiary</Button>

// ✅ GOOD - Use size props
